/*
 * snippet::suggestion — the edit a diagnostic proposes, and the pair of lines
 * it prints as.
 *
 * A suggestion is an edit and not a sentence: an `Edit` is one or two spans
 * and the text replacing each, which is what an LSP quick fix consumes, and a
 * `Fix` is that edit already applied to the line it edits. The `+` line is
 * produced here and nowhere else, cf. `applyEdit` — a rendering written
 * alongside an edit is a rendering that can disagree with it.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::errors::snippet::suggestion
 * @File: ymirc/errors/snippet/suggestion.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
